{"seq":2,"slug":"isotonic-vs-platt","title":"保序与 Platt 缩放：非参数 vs 参数化校准的抉择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/calibration/isotonic-vs-platt","wordCount":1340,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"保序与-platt-缩放-非参数-vs-参数化校准的抉择\">保序与 Platt 缩放：非参数 vs 参数化校准的抉择</h1><p>校准工具箱里两把主刀刀刃相对：保序回归无形状假设、灵活但吃数据；Platt 缩放假设 sigmoid、只两个参数、省数据但会因形状误设而偏。选错的代价很具体——小样本上用保序会过拟合出锯齿概率，大样本上用 Platt 会在真实校准曲线偏离 sigmoid 处系统性残留误差。本篇把两者放在同一张台面上正面对比，给出基于样本量的决策规则，并把深度学习时代的温度缩放作为 Platt 的现代变体一并厘清。它承接 <a href=\"probability-calibration\">概率校准</a> 的流水线，为 <a href=\"reliability-diagrams\">可靠性图</a> 的过拟合诊断做铺垫。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两种映射的本质差异\">核心概念：两种映射的本质差异</h2><p>Platt 缩放对原始打分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 拟合一个 sigmoid：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p} = \\frac{1}{1 + \\exp(A \\cdot s + B)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2574em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有两个参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A, B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，在校准集上用极大似然拟合。它假设「真实校准曲线是 sigmoid 形」——这个假设强，但也正是它省数据、稳健的来源。保序回归则如 <a href=\"../foundations/monotonic-constraint\">单调约束</a> 所述，只要求映射单调，输出分段常数，自由度随数据自适应。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原始打分 s] --&gt; B{校准集大小?}&#10;  B --&gt;|小, &lt; ~1000| C[Platt/温度缩放&lt;br/&gt;2参数 抗过拟合]&#10;  B --&gt;|大, ≥ ~1000| D[保序回归&lt;br/&gt;无形状假设 更灵活]&#10;  A --&gt; E{真实校准曲线形状?}&#10;  E --&gt;|近似 sigmoid| C&#10;  E --&gt;|非 sigmoid/复杂单调| D&#10;  C --&gt; F[光滑 sigmoid 输出]&#10;  D --&gt; G[分段常数 台阶输出]&#10;  F --&gt; H[形状误设→系统残差]&#10;  G --&gt; I[数据不足→过拟合锯齿]\">graph TD\n  A[原始打分 s] --&gt; B{校准集大小?}\n  B --&gt;|小, &lt; ~1000| C[Platt/温度缩放&lt;br/&gt;2参数 抗过拟合]\n  B --&gt;|大, ≥ ~1000| D[保序回归&lt;br/&gt;无形状假设 更灵活]\n  A --&gt; E{真实校准曲线形状?}\n  E --&gt;|近似 sigmoid| C\n  E --&gt;|非 sigmoid/复杂单调| D\n  C --&gt; F[光滑 sigmoid 输出]\n  D --&gt; G[分段常数 台阶输出]\n  F --&gt; H[形状误设→系统残差]\n  G --&gt; I[数据不足→过拟合锯齿]</pre><p>下表是两者的完整对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Platt 缩放</th>\n<th>保序回归</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>形状假设</td>\n<td>sigmoid（强）</td>\n<td>仅单调（弱）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数量</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>随数据自适应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小样本表现</td>\n<td>稳健</td>\n<td>易过拟合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大样本表现</td>\n<td>受限于 sigmoid 误设</td>\n<td>一致逼近真实曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>形状误设风险</td>\n<td>高（非 sigmoid 时残差）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出形态</td>\n<td>光滑</td>\n<td>分段常数（台阶）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外推行为</td>\n<td>自然外推</td>\n<td>需 <code>out_of_bounds</code> 处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极端概率</td>\n<td>不会给 0/1</td>\n<td>边界块可能给 0 或 1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"样本量-约-1000-是分水岭\">样本量：约 1000 是分水岭</h2><p>选择的首要依据是校准集大小，这有实证支撑。Niculescu-Mizil 与 Caruana 的经典研究以及后续多数据集复现一致发现：<strong>当校准样本达到约 1000 个及以上时，保序回归的表现总是不劣于、通常优于 Platt 缩放</strong>；样本更少时保序容易过拟合，Platt 更稳。2025 年一项跨多数据集多架构的严格对比（arXiv:2509.23665）进一步用配对 t 检验加 Bonferroni 校正（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.003</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0.003</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.003</span></span></span></span></span>）确认，在充足数据下保序在 ECE 与 Brier 分数上以统计显著优势胜出。</p>\n<p>这个阈值不是硬线而是量级参考。实践中还要看<strong>正例数量</strong>而非总样本——高度不平衡数据里 1 万条样本可能只有 50 个正例，保序在稀疏区仍会过拟合。此时或降级到 Platt，或用 <a href=\"../foundations/isotonic-taxonomy\">谱系</a> 里的居中保序/近保序等正则化变体，或做交叉拟合扩大有效样本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"温度缩放-深度学习时代的-platt\">温度缩放：深度学习时代的 Platt</h2><p>Platt 缩放为二分类 SVM 而生。深度多分类网络的现代对应是<strong>温度缩放（temperature scaling）</strong>：不对每类单独拟合，而是用单个标量温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 去除以 softmax 前的 logits 向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p} = \\mathrm{softmax}(z / T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">softmax</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在校准集上以 NLL 最小化学出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 软化分布（治过度自信），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 锐化。它是 Platt 的多类单参数特例，Guo 等 2017 证明它简单却极有效，成为深网校准的默认基线。它的关键优点是<strong>保持 argmax 不变</strong>（除以正标量不改最大项位置），因此不影响 top-1 精度——与保序「不改排序」的性质异曲同工。</p>\n<p>温度缩放的弱点是只有一个自由度，无法修正「不同置信区间失准程度不同」的情形；此时可上分段温度、向量缩放，或对每类打分接一个一维保序。深网里也有把 focal loss 等训练期手段与后处理校准结合的路线，但后处理仍以温度缩放和保序为两大支柱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组合与实务建议\">组合与实务建议</h2><p>两者不必二选一。常见的组合是<strong>先温度缩放去除整体过度自信、再对结果接保序做细粒度修正</strong>，兼顾稳健与灵活。实务决策可归纳为一条流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>校准集正例数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span></span></span></span></span> 几百 → Platt/温度缩放。</li>\n<li>正例数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span></span></span></span></span> 约 1000 且怀疑校准曲线非 sigmoid → 保序回归。</li>\n<li>深度多分类、只求快速稳健基线 → 温度缩放。</li>\n<li>保序过拟合（可靠性图见锯齿）→ 换居中保序或加交叉拟合，诊断方法见 <a href=\"reliability-diagrams\">可靠性图与过拟合</a>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>在 scikit-learn 里，Platt 对应 <code>CalibratedClassifierCV(method=&#39;sigmoid&#39;)</code>，保序对应 <code>method=&#39;isotonic&#39;</code>，切换只改一个字符串，落地细节见 <a href=\"../practice/isotonic-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Platt 假设 sigmoid、2 参数、省数据但形状误设时有系统残差；保序无形状假设、灵活但吃数据。</li>\n<li>决策主依据是校准集大小：约 1000 正例以上保序通常胜出，以下 Platt 更稳；看正例数而非总数。</li>\n<li>温度缩放是 Platt 的深网单参数变体，除以标量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 不改 argmax，是多分类校准默认基线。</li>\n<li>两者可组合：先温度缩放去整体过度自信，再保序细修。</li>\n<li>sklearn 里 <code>method=&#39;sigmoid&#39;</code> 与 <code>&#39;isotonic&#39;</code> 一键切换。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：校准的基础概念与流水线，见 <a href=\"probability-calibration\">概率校准</a>；保序过拟合的诊断与缓解，见 <a href=\"reliability-diagrams\">可靠性图与过拟合</a>；正则化变体，见 <a href=\"../foundations/isotonic-taxonomy\">谱系</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：分布偏移让任何后处理校准失效，见 <a href=\"../../conformal-prediction-uncertainty/practice/distribution-shift\">分布偏移</a>；校准漂移的线上监控，见 <a href=\"../../data-drift-model-monitoring/foundations/why-monitoring\">为何监控</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"保序与 Platt 缩放：非参数 vs 参数化校准的抉择","id":"保序与-platt-缩放-非参数-vs-参数化校准的抉择"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两种映射的本质差异","id":"核心概念-两种映射的本质差异"},{"level":2,"text":"样本量：约 1000 是分水岭","id":"样本量-约-1000-是分水岭"},{"level":2,"text":"温度缩放：深度学习时代的 Platt","id":"温度缩放-深度学习时代的-platt"},{"level":2,"text":"组合与实务建议","id":"组合与实务建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"概率校准：让分类器的 0.9 真的是 90%","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/calibration/probability-calibration"},"next":{"title":"可靠性图与过拟合：诊断保序校准的成色","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/calibration/reliability-diagrams"}}